!Name: p3lwssreflect-1
!C A pair of period 3 c/3 convoys which reflect a pair of LWSSs back
!C and forth between them as they recede from each other.  This is an
!C improvement of a previous version of this object.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
